WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
A synthetic world in Neuraxic’s current interface. Choose a tome to begin.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.100
Open the world, then focus on one of its elements.

3
00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:12.160
Established claims and an unsealed proposal remain visibly distinct.

4
00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:18.200
Read the draft beside rule, name and quantity suggestions. No offer is accepted.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:24.300
View typed relationships around the same focus.

6
00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:28.400
Switch lenses to inspect time-marked claims. The proposal keeps its dashed outline.

7
00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:34.480
Return to the unsealed proposal. Navigation only: no content was saved or promoted.
